          <!-- Project Details Card -->
          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-4 border border-light-subtle shadow-sm mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 font-luxury text-dark mb-4">Project Highlights &amp; Execution Details</h2>
            
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3 class="h5 font-luxury text-dark mb-2">Smart Layout Planning for 2BHK Compact Luxury</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                Located in Sector 15 Ghansoli, this 2BHK flat interior in Neelkanth Sunbless demonstrates how intelligent spatial planning can maximize carpet efficiency without sacrificing aesthetic luxury. Features include a sleek compact foyer shoe cabinet, a floating TV wall with charcoal acoustic louvers, concealed 3000K warm LED profile channels, and seamless glass partitions separating the living and dining zones.
