                All cabinetry, wardrobes, lofts, and modular kitchen carcasses are built strictly from IS:710 Boiling Water Proof (BWP) Marine Plywood with automated German PUR hot-melt edge sealing. The bedrooms feature anti-scratch soft-matte acrylic shutters, top-hung sliding tracks, hydraulic under-bed storage, and Royale luxury paint on masonry.
