      <img src="/assets/images/delivered-projects/neelkanth-sunbless-ghansoli/5.webp" alt="Modular Kitchen & Breakfast Counter" />
      <img src="/assets/images/delivered-projects/neelkanth-sunbless-ghansoli/6.webp" alt="Kitchen Cabinets & Built-In Appliances" />
      <img src="/assets/images/delivered-projects/neelkanth-sunbless-ghansoli/7.webp" alt="Second Bedroom Wardrobe & Study Area" />
